      "cooked": "<p>This came up yesterday in my regular sentinels group.&nbsp;</p><p>My friend was playing Fanatic and was about to play Embolden when he asked a rather interesting question.&nbsp;</p><p>\"Hey foote, so I know this one purple shadowy hero is visionary clearly...but who is that blueish one flying above her?\"</p><p>\"Probably legacy, see the cape?\"</p><p>\"Yeah but, it looks like he is wearing a full head mask. Even has a kinda bird like nose and ruffles in the back. That doesn't look like any hero I've seen.\"</p><p>Upon further inspection, I may have to give him credit. That's a cape. That's a mask. He's flying. But that is not Legacy.&nbsp;</p><p>So, my fellow SotM speculators, tell me.&nbsp;</p><p>Who is that?</p>",
